# Normalize text to LF in the repository and in every checkout.
#
# `cargo xtask check-bindings` compares the committed generated files byte for
# byte with what the generator writes (LF). A Windows checkout with
# core.autocrlf=true turned them into CRLF and the check failed on CI even
# though nothing was stale. Pinning LF keeps generated files, formatters and
# the check in agreement on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-only scripts keep CRLF, which PowerShell and cmd expect.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Binary assets are never converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.exe binary
*.msi binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
